{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415772","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415772","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1041577201:0":{"text":"마르, 얘 좀 봐라!","source_cn":"马尔，看这家伙！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x432843433ECB719C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041577202:0":{"text":"헤헤, 카르! 얘도 머리가 두 개다!","source_cn":"嘿嘿，喀尔！他也有两个头！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8D05246B858F1B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041577203:0":{"text":"멍청아, 세 개다!","source_cn":"蠢货，是三个头！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C9B1EDA85612ED5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041577204:0":{"text":"머리가 아니라 화포다.","source_cn":"不是头，枪炮。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x228508548D8979AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041577205:1":{"text":"저게 무슨 말이냐?","source_cn":"他什么意思？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8C8B1ED6616FA93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041577206:1":{"text":"화포, 화력으로! 부순다!","source_cn":"枪炮！火力！轰碎！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8E884258A3944BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041577207:1":{"text":"알았으니까 진정해!","source_cn":"好了！冷静！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BAC4289D972A2D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041577208:1":{"text":"그래. 너, 군나르라고? 머리 두 개 중에 하나는 화포, 하나는 화력이냐?","source_cn":"明白了，你叫勒图姆，你这两个头，一个叫枪炮，一个叫火力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x570D6E6A5DD22450","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041577209:1":{"text":"그건 안 된다! 나는 카르, 얘는 마르. 우리 둘을 합치면 카르마다!","source_cn":"这可不行。就像我叫喀尔，他叫马尔。我们合起来叫喀尔马。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5228E051ACAD0CE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041577210:1":{"text":"그러니까 네 머리에 더 그럴듯한 이름을 지어 줘라!","source_cn":"你得给他俩起更像样的名字！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x101F16813B1D2AED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041577211:1":{"text":"...이름?","source_cn":"……名字？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD45E871BDCF265B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","docume